=== meta
title = "geml codemap build — options"
===

# Build options {#build-options}

=== table {#fields .form format=csv delim=|}
field      | kind    | label            | required | default          | options              | help
root       | path    | Repo root        | false    | .                |                      | `--root` — defaults to the current directory
out        | path    | Output dir       | false    | .geml-code-graph |                      | `--out`
container  | select  | Granularity      | false    | module           | module dir file      | `--container`
adapter    | select  | Adapter          | false    |                  | joern scip           | pairs with `--raw`; mutually exclusive with `--db`
db         | path    | Graph DB         | false    |                  |                      | `--db`; mutually exclusive with `--adapter`
raw        | path    | Raw indexer out  | false    |                  |                      | required *when* `--adapter` is given
lang       | text    | Language         | false    |                  |                      | `--lang JAVASRC|NEWC|…`
joern      | path    | Joern binary     | false    |                  |                      | `--joern`
exclude    | text    | Exclude glob     | false    |                  |                      | **repeatable**
history    | boolean | Snapshot history | false    | false            |                      | `--history`
message    | text    | Commit message   | false    |                  |                      | only meaningful with `--history`
===
